Value Required VERSION (\S.*?)
Value MODEL (\S+)
Value UPTIME (\S.*?)
Value SERIAL (\S+)

Start
  ^VRP\s+\(R\)\s+[Ss]oftware,\s+Version\s+${VERSION}\s*$$
  ^(?:HUAWEI|Huawei|Quidway)\s+${MODEL}\s+(?:\S+\s+)*?uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$
  ^\s*ESN\s+of\s+\S+(?:\s+\S+)?\s*:\s*${SERIAL}\s*$$ -> Rest

Rest
  ^.*$$
